  "provenance": "Both profiles built byte-identical copies of six production Buffer modules. Four close scenarios plus nine append/allocator regressions ran per profile. The v2 instrumented FY heap reports total allocation attempts and frees. Each close or append scenario has exactly one initial native allocation and one final free; closing does not allocate. The empty-root close subcase performs no native allocation. The baseline identifies pre-commit provenance; input hashes identify the tested implementation."
